  "title": "Very Best Blueberry Cobbler!",
  "description": "Use fresh or frozen blueberries in this blueberry cobbler recipe. The sweetened berries are topped with a cakey biscuit crust for the perfect summer treat.",
  "authors": [
    "FRIENDLYFOOD"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:12:21-04:00",
