  "ingredients": [
    "2.5 cups fresh or frozen blueberries",
    "0.5 lemon, juiced",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1 cup white sugar, or to taste",
    "0.5 teaspoon all-purpose flour",
    "1 tablespoon butter, melted",
    "1.75 cups all-purpose flour",
    "4 teaspoons baking powder",
    "6 tablespoons white sugar",
    "5 tablespoons butter",
    "1 cup milk",
    "2 teaspoons sugar",
    "1 pinch ground cinnamon"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Lightly grease an 8-inch square baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BauqJe-sYYZqSltuzKDNejw2NK0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/87170-very-best-blueberry-cobbler-DDMFS-Step-01-4534-02a2c6f9f4ca43c9b96f5ac3625e9565.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/87170/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place blueberries into the baking dish and mix with lemon juice and vanilla. Sprinkle with 1 cup sugar and 1/2 teaspoon flour, then stir in 1 tablespoon melted butter. Set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qAW595gP6ulPgJp9jtRphmOW0eA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/87170-very-best-blueberry-cobbler-DDMFS-Step-02-4535-8b0faa5356c24da6b1602aa111f8cc59.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/87170/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir 1 ¾ cups flour, baking powder, and 6 tablespoons sugar together in a medium bowl. Cut in 5 tablespoons butter with a pastry blender until mixture resembles coarse crumbs.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yCZKKYAT4xUif8jqhWjhQOWCsiQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/87170-very-best-blueberry-cobbler-DDMFS-Step-03-4536-046950f513e442509089a2223d40c81f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/87170/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make a well in the center, pour in milk, and stir quickly until just moistened; you should have a very thick batter or a very wet dough. Add a splash more milk if needed. Cover and let rest for 10 minutes. Meanwhile, preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZKDicLVWlldF417gr3O28xowjX0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/87170-very-best-blueberry-cobbler-DDMFS-Step-04-4537-937de7d9ee614aca9ec9b2845e4356f7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/87170/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon rested batter over blueberries, leaving only a few small holes for the berries to peek through. Mix 2 teaspoons sugar and cinnamon together in a small bowl; sprinkle over the batter.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/kgyTXtq5Vlhd8xPqFQnL0aKp5PQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/87170-very-best-blueberry-cobbler-DDMFS-Step-05-4538-24fda3be7c1a41bca5424a4b3bcd7446.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/87170/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until golden brown on top and a knife inserted into the topping comes out clean, about 25 minutes to 35 minutes. Let cool until just warm before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1gOMYobESDY6S_-3gAgo_osn28k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/87170-very-best-blueberry-cobbler-DDMFS-Step-06-4561-b5695533c7be4805a6129453d9b21e75.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/87170/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1btSXQHFRgrA0rFOaQDXS_JQq7s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/87170-very-best-blueberry-cobbler-DDMFS-4x3-4570-49dee353953d4289a267f285ee98554e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/87170/step_07.webp"
    }
  ],
